# Route: guide 42 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1539 of 1546 eligible quests, 166.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 57 to
# 59, 59 quests, 3.7 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Duskwood, Teldrassil, Winterspring, Elwynn Forest, Redridge Mountains,
# Western Plaguelands, Stonetalon Mountains, Blasted Lands): Darkshire ->
# Tranquil Gardens Cemetery -> Darkshire -> Brightwood Grove -> The Yorgen
# Farmstead -> Vul'Gol Ogre Mound -> Darkshire -> Manor Mistmantle -> Tranquil
# Gardens Cemetery -> Darkshire -> Raven Hill Cemetery -> Addle's Stead ->
# Darkshire -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Mor'Ladim (228; Mor'Ladim 35);
# Oakenscowl (2499; Oakenscowl 9).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Crime and Punishment (377), Crime and Punishment (377), In
# Search of Thaelrid (1198), Twilight Falls (1199), Drakefire Amulet (6502),
# What Comes Around... (386), What Comes Around... (386), Songblade Search
# (95772), Songblade Search (95772), Barov Family Fortune (5343), Doctor
# Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher (5382), Kirtonos the Herald (5384), The Lich,
# Ras Frostwhisper (5466), Krastinov's Bag of Horrors (5515), Of Love and
# Family (5848), Vyletongue Corruption (7041), Corruption of Earth and Seed
# (7065), Nekrum's Medallion (2991).

